  "effectTemplate": "Increases the wearer's CRIT Rate by <color=#f29e38ff>#1[i]%</color>. When any ally character consumes a total of #3[i] or more Skill Points in a single turn, the wearer gains \"Radiant Crown,\" lasting for #4[i] turn(s). While the wearer holds \"Radiant Crown,\" all allies' DMG dealt ignores <color=#f29e38ff>#5[i]%</color> of the target's DEF, and the Skill DMG dealt by the wearer increases by <color=#f29e38ff>#2[i]%</color>. Effects of the same type cannot stack.",
